#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0241B expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "TRTAG1N is not declared. The expansion still happens (TRTAGy matches TRTAG1, tuple y=1; TRTAGyN has no instance and is synthesised as the absent TRTAG1N), and Requirements.Variables.All ['TRTAGyN'] rewrites to ['TRTAG1N'] for this tuple -- which is absent, so the rule is reported not executed with the Requirements.Variables reason. Not a wildcard NoMatch skip: one column did match."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col TRTAG1  type=Char
